{
  "source": "Prompts/build-your-skills-opener-v7.mp4",
  "duration": 148.5013125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.5,
      "text": "This final section transitions from technical operation to human durability."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.2,
      "end": 10.28,
      "text": "You are moving beyond the interface to cement the instincts that outlast any software update."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.06,
      "end": 13.8,
      "text": "Think back to when you learned to ride a bike."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.3,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "There was a specific moment your feet left the ground and you found your balance."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.66,
      "end": 20.82,
      "text": "Eventually, you outgrew that childhood bike."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.24,
      "end": 24.54,
      "text": "You left it behind and moved on to something larger or faster."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.84,
      "end": 26.96,
      "text": "But you didn't leave the balance behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.96,
      "end": 31.02,
      "text": "The vehicle was temporary, but the physical intuition stayed with you."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.64,
      "end": 34.3,
      "text": "That invisible intuition carried over completely."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.82,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "It made you better at gliding across a skating rink or navigating a basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.64,
      "end": 42.04,
      "text": "Nobody could download that balance into your brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.52,
      "end": 45.72,
      "text": "You had to actively construct it yourself through practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.38,
      "end": 51.8,
      "text": "We will cover some specific AI techniques here, but our main focus is on that internal balance."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.24,
      "end": 56.64,
      "text": "We want to build the enduring human skills that belong entirely to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.64,
      "end": 59.3,
      "text": "Your choices and the questions you ask."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.88,
      "end": 62.34,
      "text": "Your judgment and the permanent skills you bring."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.08,
      "end": 65.66,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what we'll explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.6,
      "end": 69.46,
      "text": "1. Use AI with skill and care."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.18,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "Question claims, weigh evidence, choose the help you need, use AI honestly, and protect what you share."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.82,
      "end": 82.64,
      "text": "As we pan down to step 2, we pivot to skills whose value actively appreciates over time."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.64,
      "end": 89.3,
      "text": "Because the machine handles the raw generation, your interpersonal skills for team collaboration"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.3,
      "end": 95.64,
      "text": "and your creative thinking to find better angles become your primary competitive advantages."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.7,
      "end": 102.46,
      "text": "Finally, step 3 emphasizes the absolute need to stay flexible and take decisive action."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.1,
      "end": 105.0,
      "text": "The technology will evolve rapidly."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.52,
      "end": 108.48,
      "text": "Your job is to keep learning as those changes happen"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.48,
      "end": 113.44,
      "text": "and translate your personal interests into action by building real world projects."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.16,
      "end": 117.22,
      "text": "The yellow banner at the bottom captures the overarching mandate."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.84,
      "end": 120.3,
      "text": "Build the skills you keep when the tool changes."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.62,
      "end": 124.22,
      "text": "Keep one central question in mind as we move forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.78,
      "end": 130.88,
      "text": "We are approaching a baseline where every single person on this network is lighting up with access to the exact same software."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.52,
      "end": 134.54,
      "text": "So what do you bring to the equation that it entirely lacks?"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.02,
      "end": 139.34,
      "text": "Everything we cover from here out is designed to help you construct your answer to that question."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.48,
      "end": 143.22,
      "text": "The tool is rented. The skills are yours to keep."
    }
  ],
